# Design Discovery — Light

Use for additive changes inside well-understood subsystems.

## Inputs
- requirements.md (approved)
- existing design.md or component documentation

## Activities
1. Identify the existing boundary(s) the work lives in.
2. Confirm contracts of touched components.
3. Plan the minimal set of files to change.
4. Verify observability still covers the changed paths.

## Outputs
- design.md sections: Existing Architecture Analysis, File Structure Plan,
  Components touched, Traceability, Rollout/Rollback if relevant.
